== Bosses and Methods of Awakening ==
Awakened Bosses spawn once at the start of every hour, if at least one player was within the Boss's vicinity. Once a boss is awakened, any number of players can participate.

Players can be informed about which boss is going to awaken by interacting with the '''[[Secrets Master]]''' NPC. (he will only reveal the info within the last 30 minutes of the hour).

A player cannot deal damage to the boss until they complete the boss's unique minigame. After the player successfully completes the minigame, the boss awakens, and fights.

* [[The Gorilla King|Gorilla King]] - Shake the tree to drop bananas.
* [[Chef]] - Place materials into the cauldron (may vary...?), inside the building behind him.
* [[Yeti (Boss)|Yeti]] - Destroy three green frozen cubes around the island while having [[Aura]] enabled.
* [[Vice Admiral]] - Man the cannons near the port, and destroy the tower.
* [[Warden]] - Pull the correct lever combination: Red-Blue-Green-Blue (same as the [[Raids|raid room]] in second sea)
* [[Magma General]] - Destroy the pressure points around the volcano.
* [[Fishman Lord]] - Find a pearl in one of the clams around the island.
* [[Sky Warlord]] - Destroy the dark purple clouds above the temple.
* [[Lightning God]] - Ring the golden bell using your [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]], [[Swords|sword]], and [[Guns|gun]] as prompted.
* [[Cyborg (Boss)|Cyborg]] - Fix the cables around the floor. You will know which ones to fix when parts of the cables light up.

After killing an awakened boss, each player that has dealt enough damage obtains a free gacha roll.

